00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:31.920
The Final Road

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:33.180
A secret base?

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:39.130
Narimasu Elementary School - 
 Closed Due to Emergency

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:39.130
<i>Without much in the way of rhyme
 or reason, we decided to head south.</i>

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:43.160
<i>For the first two days, we mainly focused on gaining distance,</i>

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:45.130
<i>and then searched for a place to sleep.</i>

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:47.110
<i>A safe place that didn't cost money,</i>

00:02:47.110 --> 00:02:49.610
<i>where we could stay sheltered from
 the rain and dew,</i>

00:02:49.610 --> 00:02:53.550
<i>and where we wouldn't
 attract people's attention.</i>

00:02:56.310 --> 00:02:57.530
All done.

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:04.160
My head feels light, and my back is warm. {hot}

00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:05.910
Do you like it?

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:08.500
Yeah.

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:19.760
NIGHT WATCH ROOM

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:19.760
Can I keep{raise // keep sounds better ~Z} this kitten?

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:23.930
M
I
L
K

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:21.300
Now, look...

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:23.930
I... I swear I'll take good care of it. {swear I'll look after}{I-I will}

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:31.700
We'll have to think of a name.

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:37.480
Um, well, let's call it Principal. {Kouchou = Principal, Keikaku means plan}

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:38.230
M
I
L
K

00:03:38.550 --> 00:03:39.660
Why that?

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:42.360
It looks like he has a little mustache under his mouth. {beard} {sth that looks like a m under}

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:45.120
NIGHT

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:45.120
WATCH

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:45.120
ROOM

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:47.700
What are you doing with that?

00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:49.590
Making a disconnection activator.

00:03:49.590 --> 00:03:52.840
If the enemy opens the door,
 the electrodes will be separated,

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:56.960
the circuit will be broken,
 and it will automatically dial us.

00:03:58.940 --> 00:04:01.260
If I make several of them and set them up,

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:05.340
the device's number will tell me where they entered from.

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:09.810
Ow, that's hot...

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:19.200
Asaba, are you out there?

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:20.330
I'm here.

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:23.360
Asaba, are you out there?

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:25.200
I'm here.

00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:29.280
Asaba, I'm getting out.

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:30.620
Asaba, I'm getting out.

00:04:33.860 --> 00:04:36.030
Is the money all right? {<- kind of an odd phrasing, but I think it makes more sense than a more liberal "are we doing okay on money"}{are we okay}

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:38.000
Yeah.

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:41.630
Since we don't have to pay for heat or power...

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:55.900
<i>A secret base that was ours alone.</i>

00:04:56.980 --> 00:05:00.070
CLOSED DUE TO AN EMERGENCY

00:04:56.980 --> 00:05:00.070
NARIMASU ELEMENTARY SCHOOL

00:04:57.580 --> 00:05:00.070
<i>We thought we were invincible.</i>

00:05:01.470 --> 00:05:03.240
Yeah, I've heard plenty of things about...

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:04.830
...the phantom of Narimasu Elementary.

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:06.410
What, you knew about it?

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:11.350
A woman with white hair is always standing on the roof, right?

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:14.370
I suppose we should
 let the police in on the story.

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:18.460
Nah it's pointless. They've got too much wartime defense stuff going on.

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:20.550
<i>Narimasu Elementary...</i>

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:22.630
Including the tax, that'll be 740 yen.

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:31.540
Oh, excuse me.

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:23.450
Asaba...

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:24.900
Who are you?

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:32.200
Heh, some ghost <i>you</i>  are.

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:47.560
Asaba-kun asked me to get his bag for him.

00:06:49.690 --> 00:06:50.300
That's a lie.

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:54.510
It's no lie. I'm telling the truth.

00:06:54.820 --> 00:06:56.790
This is <i>our</i>  secret base.

00:06:56.790 --> 00:06:59.140
Asaba would never tell anyone about it!

00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:11.780
Lowlifes like you can go ahead and die!

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:44.690
2 packs of razors ¥1500 
+ 2 cans of cat food ¥1200 
 = ¥2700

00:08:35.370 --> 00:08:36.250
Ir-

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:51.000
Nothing was done to me.

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:55.050
He just grabbed me and pushed me down.

00:09:03.860 --> 00:09:05.430
That scared me.

00:09:05.430 --> 00:09:07.490
Put that thing away already.

00:09:08.380 --> 00:09:10.280
D-Do you want some dinner?

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:17.520
You there? What happened?

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:19.140
Hello? Hello?

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:20.690
I went to a convenience store.

00:09:20.690 --> 00:09:24.650
The price of cup noodles, toothpaste... of everything has gone up.

00:09:24.650 --> 00:09:26.290
It's pretty bad. {terrible}

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:33.300
L-Let's just share mine.

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:40.350
Sorry, it's my fault.
 I didn't tell you everything.

00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:46.250
I-I regret it, but I stood in the store and read for a while. {thought we could make do}

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:49.900
After that, I bought some 
canned cat food and some razors.

00:09:50.390 --> 00:09:51.510
That's why...

00:09:51.510 --> 00:09:53.480
Nothing was done to me!

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:55.030
Like I said...

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:57.360
I stabbed him with intent to kill.

00:10:06.650 --> 00:10:08.080
What about Principal?

00:10:08.570 --> 00:10:09.850
Where's Principal?

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:13.960
There's no time to worry about the cat!
We have to get out of here!

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:16.870
No, we have to take Principal with us!

00:10:16.870 --> 00:10:18.910
We have to leave together! {he's going with us / coming with us too}

00:10:20.350 --> 00:10:22.680
We have to... leave together...

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:29.140
All right, I'll go get Principal.

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:32.980
You run on ahead. I'll catch up later!

00:10:33.710 --> 00:10:35.440
Start running, now!

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:41.870
I'll be sure to bring Principal with me.

00:10:42.290 --> 00:10:43.280
Asa...

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:46.440
Hurry up and go! Run!

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:01.170
Asaba...

00:11:22.930 --> 00:11:24.990
Nothing was done to me.

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:29.090
Really, nothing... Nothing was done to me!

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:33.380
It doesn't matter at all. {don't care}

00:11:33.720 --> 00:11:36.420
It doesn't make a bit of difference{, guys, the balls are inert}!

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:40.400
 It has nothing to do with me!
It's depressing to hear that over and over again!

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:42.760
Worrying about you has got me worn out!{Lunar: You're weighing me down and suffocating me with your clumsiness.} {Ayu: mentally/physically exhausted} {AnY-Spork: wasted my time to take care of your sloppiness; I'm fed up with it} {I think Ayu's closest here.}

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:44.010
I'm sick of it all!

00:11:44.560 --> 00:11:47.860
Don't follow me. Don't let me see your face ever again!

00:12:11.550 --> 00:12:14.050
I stabbed him with intent to kill...

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:28.560
Go back to the base by yourself,
 you stupid girl!

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:31.090
And learn to wipe your own nosebleeds! {u can clean up just fine}{wipe ur nb urself}

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:40.200
I'm sorry. I went a little overboard.

00:12:41.310 --> 00:12:42.880
Let's get going.

00:12:43.350 --> 00:12:47.700
Aren't you hungry? Let's get something to eat in the next town. {fsc, but good lead-out anyway}

00:12:48.320 --> 00:12:49.520
Iriya...

00:12:49.520 --> 00:12:51.290
I'm not going. I'm waiting.

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:53.620
For who? The people from the base?

00:12:54.480 --> 00:12:56.100
I'm waiting for Asaba.

00:12:56.630 --> 00:13:00.150
Hey, I know I was too harsh back there.

00:13:00.150 --> 00:13:01.730
So let's...

00:13:01.730 --> 00:13:03.170
I'm waiting for Asaba.

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:06.340
Iriya...?

00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:09.990
Iriya, who am I?

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:20.250
Let's go.

00:13:20.250 --> 00:13:24.190
What about Asaba? He's not here.
 I'm going to wait until he arrives.

00:13:24.620 --> 00:13:29.320
Well, "Asaba" told me he'd be
waiting near that bridge up ahead.

00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:31.720
Come on, hurry up.

00:13:31.720 --> 00:13:33.160
"Green light." 

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:35.620
What's Orange Pekoe?

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:36.160
"Dozing Coffeehouse"

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:39.420
Closed due to circumstances.

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:39.420
"Dozing" Storekeeper

00:13:36.160 --> 00:13:39.420
I said, "Orange Pekoe and a strawberry parfait."

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:43.260
I think there is a kind of black tea
 with that name, but... {western tea}

00:13:43.780 --> 00:13:46.510
Hey Iriya, who am I?

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:47.760
Akiho.

00:13:48.020 --> 00:13:51.730
If I can get some data for an article,
 I can be as good as Asaba.

00:13:57.640 --> 00:13:58.520
Iriya?

00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:11.120
Hey, Iriya.

00:14:11.520 --> 00:14:12.870
"Body Spike." {idk what this is, maybe knowing the novels would give more context ~Z}

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:17.170
Come on, Iriya. It's dangerous up here,
 so let's go down.

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:20.650
Sakisaka, can you do the bonfire dance? {you dance-dance?}

00:14:20.650 --> 00:14:24.710
Shiina taught me how to do it,
 and I practiced a whole lot.

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:28.680
I practiced so I would be able to dance 
with Asaba at the bonfire.

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:31.970
Sakisaka, do you know about the bonfire?

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:34.260
Iriya, what's today's date?

00:14:35.790 --> 00:14:37.350
Don't you know?

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:38.650
I know.

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:44.690
Today is September 21st.
 The school festival starts tomorrow. {joined}

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:47.030
And the bonfire is the day after tomorrow.

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:51.360
Enomoto said he'd make sure 
I wouldn't have to sortie that day.

00:14:52.730 --> 00:14:53.900
Hey...

00:14:55.300 --> 00:14:58.170
Sakisaka, can you do the bonfire dance?

00:14:56.830 --> 00:15:00.920
Iriya's Sky

00:14:56.830 --> 00:15:00.920
