00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:02.780
Iriya!

00:15:02.780 --> 00:15:04.220
Get away from me.

00:15:07.390 --> 00:15:09.050
You know...

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:09.050
You're annoying.

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:13.460
Hey, Iriya, who am I?

00:15:13.460 --> 00:15:14.850
Shiina.

00:15:15.630 --> 00:15:18.380
I knew someone would come to keep an eye on me.

00:15:19.070 --> 00:15:20.480
What do you want?

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:22.500
Umm, what's today's date?

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:24.090
Umm, what's today's date?

00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:27.360
It's the first Sunday of the second trimester.

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:38.600
Aren't you meeting Asaba at 10?

00:15:38.600 --> 00:15:42.660
Look, it's not even 7:00,
 and the movie starts at 10:30.

00:15:41.990 --> 00:15:43.260
Your point?

00:15:43.810 --> 00:15:46.380
Asaba won't come,
 no matter long you wait. {A isn't coming no matter how long you wait}

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:47.570
He will!

00:15:48.790 --> 00:15:50.880
Because he promised. {we made a }

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:52.550
Get away from me, you idiot!

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:02.880
Sorry, did you wait long?

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:05.640
Who am I?

00:16:05.640 --> 00:16:06.610
Kakki.

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:08.110
Who's <i>that?</i>

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:17.450
Iriya!

00:16:18.480 --> 00:16:19.700
Don't touch me.

00:16:20.240 --> 00:16:22.550
I'm fine. Get away from me.

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:29.020
Hey, young man.

00:16:31.390 --> 00:16:37.080
I'm not one to meddle in others' affairs,
 but I just can't take it anymore.

00:16:37.080 --> 00:16:39.220
What in the world is going on here?

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:42.060
Isn't that girl waiting for <i>you?</i>

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:45.350
You're mistaken. Iriya is waiting for Asaba.

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:49.720
If that's the case, then go bring this "Asaba" guy over here.

00:16:52.630 --> 00:16:53.830
Why can't you?

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:56.250
Because he's somewhere far away from here. {fsc}

00:16:56.250 --> 00:16:58.980
Then why don't you 
pick up a phone and call him?

00:16:58.980 --> 00:17:02.410
If you have them talk it over, that girl will understand.

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:09.140
What? What's gotten you all riled up?

00:17:09.140 --> 00:17:10.720
I'm going to call Iriya. {give I a call}

00:17:10.720 --> 00:17:14.480
Wait a moment. 
What's the point of <i>you</i> calling her?

00:17:14.480 --> 00:17:16.380
"Asaba" is me.

00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:26.900
Here. Asaba-kun asked me
 to give this to you.

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:36.700
Hello?

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:38.030
Asaba?

00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:41.490
Hey, Iriya, who am I?

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:45.020
Asaba. I can tell by your voice.

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:47.800
Hey, I'm sorry I'm so late.

00:17:47.800 --> 00:17:50.190
I should have called you much earlier.

00:17:50.190 --> 00:17:52.380
That's fine, I just...

00:17:52.690 --> 00:17:54.970
I just got here, myself.

00:17:55.990 --> 00:17:58.820
Asaba, where are you right now?

00:17:59.230 --> 00:18:01.820
I'm kinda far away right now.

00:18:01.820 --> 00:18:05.580
And... well... a lot of things happened.

00:18:05.580 --> 00:18:08.170
A lot has changed since then.

00:18:08.170 --> 00:18:10.850
For now, I don't think I can get back there.

00:18:10.850 --> 00:18:15.420
So I won't be able to see
 the movie with you today.

00:18:16.850 --> 00:18:18.070
All right.

00:18:18.430 --> 00:18:22.010
I'm so sorry for making you wait
 such a long time.

00:18:22.010 --> 00:18:23.060
It's all right.

00:18:24.530 --> 00:18:27.150
Asaba, are you coming to school tomorrow?

00:18:27.150 --> 00:18:28.310
Y-Yeah.

00:18:28.310 --> 00:18:29.920
Then I'll go, too. {fsc}

00:18:30.970 --> 00:18:34.590
I'll see you tomorrow at school.

00:18:35.240 --> 00:18:36.920
Thanks for calling me.

00:18:36.370 --> 00:18:36.920
Huh?

00:18:37.250 --> 00:18:41.430
Even though it's Sunday,
 I was able to talk to you.

00:18:41.980 --> 00:18:43.820
I'm glad I waited.

00:18:49.890 --> 00:18:50.910
Iriya!

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:55.860
You can stay here for today.

00:18:55.860 --> 00:18:59.610
But tomorrow, I'm turning you in to the police.

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:01.060
I think that's for the best.

00:19:01.060 --> 00:19:02.370
Ah, well...

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:06.290
We'll leave right after dawn.
 We won't cause you any trouble.

00:19:06.760 --> 00:19:09.690
And if that doesn't work for you,
 we can leave right away.

00:19:09.690 --> 00:19:11.180
Where do you plan to go?

00:19:11.180 --> 00:19:12.700
To my grandmother's house.

00:19:12.700 --> 00:19:13.760
Where's that?

00:19:13.760 --> 00:19:17.520
A place called Sonokizawa.
 It's a long ways south of here. {fsc}

00:19:17.520 --> 00:19:19.880
It's close to a swimming area.

00:19:20.370 --> 00:19:22.660
Wait, how do you plan to <i>get</i>  there?

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:25.200
Isn't that past the last stop on this line?

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:27.270
We can take a bus once we get off the train.

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:29.940
Look here, the bus service stopped today.

00:19:29.940 --> 00:19:33.120
And the normal passenger trains stopped running yesterday.

00:19:33.820 --> 00:19:36.630
Have you forgotten that we're at war?

00:19:36.630 --> 00:19:39.790
The Self-Defense Force has already taken over the rail lines.

00:19:39.790 --> 00:19:41.490
They've even started rationing fuel.

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:45.530
What's made you come this far?

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:48.630
Why is that girl's hair pure white?

00:19:48.630 --> 00:19:51.060
Who exactly <i>are</i>  you two, anyway? {fsc}

00:19:51.060 --> 00:19:52.310
I can't tell you.

00:19:52.310 --> 00:19:53.380
Why not?

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:56.540
If I did, it might cause trouble for you.

00:19:58.230 --> 00:20:01.110
Fine, but let me tell you one thing.

00:20:01.890 --> 00:20:04.510
I don't want to get involved in any trouble. {don't go telling me you don't need it / involved in any trouble}

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:09.610
So once you leave here, whatever happens to you is none of my concern.{in exchange, I know nothing about what happens with the 2 of u from now on} {Whatever happens 2 u after this doesn't concern me}

00:20:09.610 --> 00:20:12.980
I-I won't say anything either,
 even if they torture me.

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:14.270
Torture?

00:20:15.320 --> 00:20:19.070
I'm going to test you.
 Let's how much you can endure.

00:20:20.230 --> 00:20:21.230
All right?

00:20:21.230 --> 00:20:22.650
O-Okay.

00:20:23.830 --> 00:20:26.210
You like this girl, don't you?

00:20:32.480 --> 00:20:35.900
<i>Military personnel train #1
 will be running tonight.</i>

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:41.300
<i>It's scheduled to pass through this station at 1:32 AM.</i>

00:20:41.950 --> 00:20:43.430
That's it. {right on time}

00:20:44.550 --> 00:20:47.180
<i>It's a driverless train, run by a computer.</i>

