00:21:32.060 --> 00:21:33.990
That sounds like something he'd say.

00:21:33.990 --> 00:21:37.660
But I won't go to school. 
I don't want to go.

00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:40.010
But you want to get in the pool, right?

00:21:40.010 --> 00:21:41.060
Yeah.

